.TH "PB-DAEMON-MACHINE-GUARD-INSTALL" "1" "Sep 2026" "Paperboat" "Paperboat CLI"

.SH NAME
pb-daemon-machine-guard-install - Install the root-owned machine guard service


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpb daemon machine-guard install [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Install the root-owned machine guard service

.PP
Install the root-owned guard service for the fixed protected 127.100.0.0/16 loopback range and configure local HTTPS certificate trust automatically.

.PP
The machine guard is a privileged local helper for protected loopback listeners and trusted local HTTPS. Installation handles certificate trust; public DNS supplies the browser names. Use the dedicated service commands for the ordinary Paperboat daemon.

.PP
JSON output is supported with --json.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for install

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	print JSON


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	configuration file

.PP
\fB--no-customization\fP[=false]
	ignore local shortcuts, command defaults, and TUI preferences

.PP
\fB--server\fP=""
	Paperboat server URL

.PP
\fB--workspace\fP=""
	resource workspace selector: personal or a team slug


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBpb-daemon-machine-guard(1)\fP
